Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Lord Ganon! Your martial prowess is truly
outstanding!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "This is exactly why I bow down to you as
my king!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Oh? Enemies are gathering around me? But
why?!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Such impressive numbers! And all so angry with us...
Perhaps it's time we did something about them...",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Fools, trying to stand against me! Then again...this many
enemies all at once is certainly a little concerning...",
  "1.0.5.0" => "I was hoping to admire Lord Ganon a while longer, but...
Yes, I'm sorry. I must be leaving for now!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "How long must I tolerate these small fry
nipping at my heels?!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "I am honored by the aid you've sent me,
Lord Ganon!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "You've saved me, Lord Ganon! Your humble servant is
rendered speechless with gratitude!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Magnificent! Nobody can hope to match
your splendor, Lord Ganon!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "You are a force to be reckoned with!
And your bloodlust can never be quenched!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "With a single gesture he scatters all who oppose him!
Lord Ganon has no equal! Kneel before his fury!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Behold, and tremble before the might of my
king!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Wonderful! Just like that, Lord Ganon!
Strike them down! Leave none standing!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "I pledge myself to you, oh Lord...",
  "1.0.15.0" => "This common rabble hardly deserves to die
by your magnificent hand, Lord Ganon...",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Such...beautiful...carnage...",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Don't relent, Lord Ganon! I want to gaze
upon your mighty deeds with renewed admiration!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Compared to your glory, Lord Ganon, they are but dust
before the wind, and they shall be blown away!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "You are the very definition of unstoppable!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Your dominance knows no bounds!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Wow, that's one big Cucco! And that beak
looks like it packs a heck of a peck!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "It's trampling all over those guys!
Do you think we could make it our ally?",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Ah, that's no good! We've got enemies
gathering over here!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "We can't stand against this many!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "We're surrounded, Link...
We have to act, or else we're done for!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "There's nothing more we can do here...",
  "1.0.27.0" => "They've got us pinned down, Link! We've
got to make like a leaf and...RUN AWAY!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Thanks for the help!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Hey, Link, we got some help!
C'mon, we better repay the favor!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "There are plenty of enemies to go around! Let's go, everybody!
Show 'em why we're the good guys!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Nice one! I didn't realize you'd gotten that
strong!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "You think you're stronger than my Cucco?
Hah!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Let's keep it going!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "No time to rest, everyone! Keep it up!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Don't lose focus now!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "You've got a good rhythm going, Link!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "I don't care how many enemies come out!
We'll get every last one!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "They just keep on coming! Stay strong,
Link!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "C'mon, Link! Let's take care of the
enemies elsewhere!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Good going, Link! You're really tearing
through those enemies!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Just a little more! Show them who's boss!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "We've overwhelmed them! But...it was just too easy.
I must admit, I'm actually a little disappointed.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "You should know better than to stand
against Lord Ganon!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Our foes are driven to despair, Lord Ganon!
I thank your immeasurable strength for that!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "My lord! Defeating an army looked like mere child's play for
you! I'm beside myself with awe!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Truly, your sublime greatness has left me
breathless!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "It was a grand battle! Your ferocity has
moved me so...",
  "1.0.48.0" => "We did it! Now, wasn't that a piece of
cake?",
  "1.0.49.0" => "We were hopelessly outnumbered, but we
prevailed!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Wow, I'm glad we're on the same side,
because that was undeniably amazing!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "You really racked up those KOs, didn't
you, Link?",
  "1.0.52.0" => "What an awesome fight! I knew we could
do it!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "You were amazing, Link! Ha ha! I'm glad
we're partners!",
}